WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:05.160
Open the tray icon, then the gear, to
reach Settings.

2
00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:09.688
Choose Sign out, and Scry Sync asks you to
confirm.

3
00:00:10.258 --> 00:00:14.848
It says your folder and files stay exactly
as they are,

4
00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:18.186
and pictures already in Scry stay there.

5
00:00:18.756 --> 00:00:25.222
Confirm, and Scry Sync signs this computer
out and returns to its sign-in screen.
